Phase 1: Core 3D Infrastructure in new_dem_0.py
1a. Quaternion utilities (new section)
quat_multiply, quat_rotate, quat_rotate_inv, quat_to_rotation_matrix, quat_from_axis_angle, quat_normalize, quat_integrate
1b. Superellipsoid geometry (new section, 3D analogs of superellipse functions)
Equation: (|x/a|^n1 + |y/b|^n1)^(n2/n1) + |z/c|^n2 = 1
superellipsoid_volume(a,b,c,n1,n2) - exact via Beta function
superellipsoid_point(eta,omega,a,b,c,n1,n2) - parametric surface
superellipsoid_normal(eta,omega,a,b,c,n1,n2) - outward unit normal
superellipsoid_curvature_radii(eta,omega,a,b,c,n1,n2) - for Hertz R_eff
superellipsoid_implicit(px,py,pz,cx,cy,cz,a,b,c,n1,n2,quat) - inside/outside test
superellipsoid_mesh(...) - triangle mesh for rendering
